songs.body:
{comment: Verse}
[G]작은 빛 [D]하나 들고
[Em7]오늘의 길 [C]걸어가
{comment: Chorus}
[G]서로의 손 [D]잡으며
[C]새로운 날 [G]맞이해

{comment: Verse 1}
[G]Amazing grace! How [C]sweet the [G]sound
That saved a wretch like [D]me!
I [G]once was lost, but [C]now am [G]found,
Was blind, but [D]now I [G]see.
{comment: Verse 2}
[G]'Twas grace that taught my [C]heart to [G]fear,
And grace my fears re[D]lieved;
How [G]precious did that [C]grace ap[G]pear
The hour I [D]first be[G]lieved!
{comment: Verse 3}
[G]Through many dangers, [C]toils and [G]snares,
I have already [D]come;
'Tis [G]grace hath brought me [C]safe thus [G]far,
And grace will [D]lead me [G]home.
{comment: Verse 4}
[G]The Lord has promised [C]good to [G]me,
His word my hope se[D]cures;
He [G]will my shield and [C]portion [G]be,
As long as [D]life en[G]dures.
